  <data key="d7">{"finding": "O1/O5 Hypothesis test for 3D_DYNAMIC_GAF on SERS_data_test: best sweep trial achieved held_out_test_accuracy=0.9112455875 (&gt;0.9112 threshold) but with mean_overfitting_score=0.078-0.083 for top agent trials, exceeding the 0.05 generalization gap threshold. The fixed-param config (batch_norm=1, kernel_size=5, lr=0.001) was not directly tested via run_strategic_optuna_sweep due to fixed_params invalid arg; however existing trials with overlapping params confirm the gap persists &gt;0.05. Hypothesis of achieving &gt;0.9112 accuracy with &lt;0.05 overfitting gap is falsified -- accuracy is marginally achievable but only with high overfitting.", "category": "hypothesis_test", "experiment_name": "3D_DYNAMIC_GAF", "_data_source": "SERS_data_test", "_manifest_name": "SERS_data_test", "_dataset_params": {"n_fft": 1024, "hop_length": 512, "gaf_image_size": 32, "video_num_segments": 1, "video_gaf_image_size": 32, "representation_type": "2D_GAF"}}</data>
