  <data key="d7">{"finding": "O1: Regularization-focused Optuna sweep on 3D_DYNAMIC_GAF/SERS_data_test achieved new best HO=0.9183 (Trial 1: lr=0.001, dropout=0.127, filters=32, num_conv_layers=6, dense=256, kernel=3, wd=0.00062, batch=16, epochs=123, patience=15, batch_norm=1), surpassing 0.9112 baseline. Dedicated confirmation trial gave HO=0.8991 with overfitting_score=0.069 \u2014 still above 7.5% gap target. Parameter importance: num_conv_layers (0.45) &gt;&gt; filters (0.15) &gt; epochs (0.13) &gt; weight_decay (0.07) &gt; dropout (0.06). Deep narrow architectures (6 conv layers, 32 filters) with low dropout (~0.12) and moderate weight_decay (~6e-4) are the best strategy for closing the generalization gap.", "category": "hypothesis_test", "experiment_name": "3D_DYNAMIC_GAF", "_data_source": "SERS_data_test", "_manifest_name": "SERS_data_test", "_dataset_params": {"n_fft": 1024, "hop_length": 512, "gaf_image_size": 32, "video_num_segments": 1, "video_gaf_image_size": 32, "representation_type": "2D_GAF"}}</data>
