  <data key="d7">{"finding": "CYCLE 12: Three systematic finetune trials for resnetd_gaf_video_enhanced.py on SERS_data_test 3D_GAF_VIDEO all failed \u2014 delta_pretrain_to_finetune was negative in every case (-0.094, -0.137, -0.050). Shifted_test_accuracy maxed at 0.346, well below the 0.5128 historical baseline. The -0.00342 optimization decline is NOT reversed; finetune consistently harms held-out accuracy. Best pretrain HO=0.903 is healthy but finetune degrades it, suggesting either the compile bug remains (model missing .compile() before finetune call) or the finetune split distribution fundamentally differs from pretrain. O2/O3/O4/O5/O6 all resolved \u2014 finetune is not viable on this architecture/manifest without fixing the pipeline compile issue first.", "category": "experiment_result", "experiment_name": "resnetd_gaf_video_enhanced.py", "_data_source": "SERS_data_test", "_manifest_name": "SERS_data_test", "_dataset_params": {"n_fft": 1024, "hop_length": 512, "gaf_image_size": 32, "video_num_segments": 1, "video_gaf_image_size": 32, "representation_type": "2D_GAF"}}</data>
