  <data key="d7">{"finding": "3D_DYNAMIC_GAF on SERS_data_test: pipeline runs cleanly (no 5D tensor bug) but HO accuracy 0.8462 (diagnostic trial) and 0.7610 (O3 trial with dropout=0.1777) are far below the historical best 0.9183 and target 0.900. Overfitting gap is 20.9%, indicating heavy regularization needed. Finetune cap exhausted (20/20) blocks O4/O5. The global best 0.9183 remains an unreplicated outlier. Next step: explore deeper architectures (more conv layers, residual connections) and wider kernel sizes to reduce overfitting, or pivot to 2D_GAF/hybrid architectures that yielded 0.904+.", "category": "system_insight", "experiment_name": "3D_DYNAMIC_GAF", "_data_source": "SERS_data_test", "_manifest_name": "SERS_data_test", "_dataset_params": {"n_fft": 1024, "hop_length": 512, "gaf_image_size": 32, "video_num_segments": 1, "video_gaf_image_size": 32, "representation_type": "2D_GAF"}}</data>
