  <data key="d7">{"finding": "advanced_d_cnn.py (1D CNN) on SERS_data_test: Optuna sweep (5 trials) best HO=0.753 with weight_decay=0.002, lr=7.7e-5, dropout=0.39, filters=64, dense_units=128. Best config: weight_decay=0.002 gave +0.41 HO over weight_decay=0.001. Still far below 0.90 target. Dropout_rate most important (0.46), weight_decay second (0.22). O4/O5 (2D_GAF on this 1D arch) blocked by dimension mismatch \u2014 requires set_optimization_model to 2D arch first. Coverage warning: batch_norm, kernel_size, epochs not swept \u2014 may be limiting.", "category": "results", "experiment_name": "advanced_d_cnn.py", "_data_source": "SERS_data_test", "_manifest_name": "SERS_data_test", "_dataset_params": {"n_fft": 1024, "hop_length": 512, "gaf_image_size": 32, "video_num_segments": 1, "video_gaf_image_size": 32, "representation_type": "2D_GAF"}}</data>
