  <data key="d7">{"finding": "Optimized_d_gaf_cnn.py trial with num_conv_layers=4, kernel_size=5, dropout_rate=0.4, weight_decay=0.0002, filters=96, lr=0.0008, batch_size=64 on SERS_data_test (2D_GAF) achieved HO=0.8174 with large overfitting gap 0.152 (train=0.982) \u2014 worse than previous baseline 0.8563. Higher capacity (filters=96, dense=192) with lower weight_decay increased overfitting. A parallel trial with weight_decay=0.001, dropout=0.5, num_conv_layers=6 had no result returned. No configuration has yet surpassed 0.8563 HO or closed overfitting gap below 0.0579. Systematic regularization sweep (weight_decay 1e-4 to 1e-3, dropout 0.4-0.6, data augmentation) is needed next cycle.", "category": "architecture_breakthrough", "experiment_name": "optimized_d_gaf_cnn.py", "_data_source": "SERS_data_test", "_manifest_name": "SERS_data_test", "_dataset_params": {"n_fft": 1024, "hop_length": 512, "gaf_image_size": 32, "video_num_segments": 1, "video_gaf_image_size": 32, "representation_type": "2D_GAF"}}</data>
