  <data key="d7">{"finding": "O1 finetune blocked (session cap 20). Alternative depth-reduction test on optimized_d_gaf_cnn.py with num_conv_layers=2 (vs prior 5-6), dropout=0.65, filters=96, kernel_size=7, dense=64, lr=0.0003, batch_size=64, weight_decay=0.0001 on SERS_data_test (2D_GAF) \u2014 tests if aggressive regularization closes the ~8.9% train-HO gap. If HO \u22650.90 with gap &lt;0.07, validates O1 hypothesis via standard trial. Finetune cap suggests reaching diminishing returns on fine-tune; future cycles should explore data augmentation or early stopping as alternative fixes.", "category": "architecture_breakdown", "experiment_name": "optimized_d_gaf_cnn.py", "_data_source": "SERS_data_test", "_manifest_name": "SERS_data_test", "_dataset_params": {"n_fft": 1024, "hop_length": 512, "gaf_image_size": 32, "video_num_segments": 1, "video_gaf_image_size": 32, "representation_type": "2D_GAF"}}</data>
