  <data key="d7">{"finding": "Cycle 38: 3D_DYNAMIC_CWT on SERS_data_test \u2014 O1 (batch_norm=1, 4 layers) HO=0.864, gap=0.129, significant improvement over previous 0.7650 confirming batch_norm=1 is critical for this architecture. O2 (dropout=0.5, weight_decay=0.01) gap=0.233 (&lt;0.291 threshold met) but HO crashed to 0.746 \u2014 aggressive regularization reduces gap at catastrophic accuracy cost. O3 not run due to budget. Best config remains Optuna trial 3 from Cycle 37: lr=0.00487, dropout=0.411, filters=128, kernel_size=5, dense=256, batch_size=48 (HO=0.8764). Persistent gap 12-23% supports data leakage hypothesis from Research Chronicle. Next: combine O1's batch_norm=1 with O2's moderate regularization to close gap without collapsing accuracy.", "category": "architecture_performance", "experiment_name": "3D_DYNAMIC_CWT", "_data_source": "SERS_data_test", "_manifest_name": "SERS_data_test", "_dataset_params": {"n_fft": 512, "hop_length": 64, "gaf_image_size": 48, "video_num_segments": 8, "video_gaf_image_size": 24, "representation_type": "2D_GAF"}}</data>
