  <data key="d7">{"finding": "3D_DYNAMIC_CWT on SERS_data_test: O1 trial with batch_norm=1, weight_decay=0.0005 achieved held_out_test_accuracy=0.820 (below 0.886 target) with overfitting gap 0.171. Best trial ever (0.864 HO) uses 5 conv layers, 256 dense units, filters=96, lr=0.0005, dropout=0.4, but still overfits (gap ~0.20). Overfitting is the dominant failure mode \u2014 train acc saturates near 0.99 while HO stagnates. Shifted test accuracy remains low (~0.32\u20130.35) indicating poor cross-session transfer. Deeper architectures with stronger regularization needed. Budget exhausted before O3 finetune could be tested.", "category": "architecture_assessment", "experiment_name": "3D_DYNAMIC_CWT", "_data_source": "SERS_data_test", "_manifest_name": "SERS_data_test", "_dataset_params": {"representation_type": "3D_DYNAMIC_CWT", "n_fft": 512, "hop_length": 64, "gaf_image_size": 48, "video_num_segments": 8, "video_gaf_image_size": 24}}</data>
