  <data key="d7">{"finding": "Cycle summary for 1D_CNN/SERS_data_test: O1 \u2014 frozen finetune (ft_unfreeze_last_n=0) failed to beat baseline (shifted_test=0.692 vs 0.716), with massive collapse on E.coli/Enterococcus after finetune; frozen backbone cannot adapt. O2/O3 \u2014 disabling batch_norm proved destructive (overfitting gap 59%), validating gradient-smoothing hypothesis. O4/O5 \u2014 dropout=0.57, lr=5e-5 gave HO=0.864 but shifted=0.367, not exceeding 0.75 threshold. No regularization config yet closes the 7.9% overfitting gap; deeper unfreezing (ft_unfreeze_last_n&gt;2) on next cycle is recommended.", "category": "architecture", "experiment_name": "1D_CNN", "_data_source": "SERS_data_test", "_manifest_name": "SERS_data_test", "_dataset_params": {}}</data>
  <data key="d8">[-0.058955000000000014, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0]</data>
