  <data key="d7">{"finding": "Cycle summary for 1D_CNN/SERS_data_test: All 4 objectives failed. O1: ft_unfreeze_last_n=4 with ft_lr=3e-5 caused catastrophic forgetting \u2014 pretrain ho=0.888 collapsed to finetune ho=0.185 (delta=-0.703). The aggressive unfreezing with low LR destroyed source features without adapting to target. O2: shifted_test=0.601 still below 0.7163 threshold. O3: dropout=0.35/batch_norm=1 gave HO=0.813 (&lt;0.900), train-HO gap=0.178 (&gt;0.080). O4: kernel_size=7/lr=0.0005 led to severe instability (HO=0.634, val_loss exploded to 12.9). Best performing config remains dropout=0.57/lr=5e-5 from last cycle (HO=0.864, shifted=0.367). The 1D_CNN architecture has exhausted exploration \u2014 7+ trials with consistent shifted test stagnation around 0.35-0.60. Recommend abandoning 1D_CNN for SERS_data_test and switching to 2D_GAF or 2D_CWT_SCALOGRAM which may better capture spectral patterns.", "category": "abandonment", "experiment_name": "1D_CNN", "_data_source": "SERS_data_test", "_manifest_name": "SERS_data_test", "_dataset_params": {}}</data>
  <data key="d8">[-0.058955000000000014, 0.09686776903327884, 0.0026497205694934454, 2.4322450086236, 2.401203762017441]</data>
</edge>
