  <data key="d7">{"finding": "2D_CWT_SCALOGRAM on SERS_data_test \u2014 O1 batch_norm=0 trial HO=0.785 (gap 0.205, worse than batch_norm=1 baseline). O3 low LR (5e-6) + low WD (5e-5) stabilized training with no NaN gradients but HO only 0.805, not surpassing 0.8502 plateau. O4 trend slope -0.0201 confirms continued decline. O5 finetune escalation: best shifted_test_accuracy=0.744 (ft_unfreeze_last_n=4, ft_lr=3e-5, seed 7 hit 0.769 but overall best 0.744), not reaching 0.76 threshold. Increasing unfreeze to 5 or lowering LR to 1e-5 reduced shifted accuracy. The 0.76 shifted target remains unmet \u2014 2D_CWT_SCALOGRAM finetune achieves partial domain adaptation but held-out collapses severely (delta -0.48 to -0.57). Architecture appears fundamentally limited for cross-session generalization on this dataset.", "category": "architecture", "experiment_name": "2D_CWT_SCALOGRAM", "_data_source": "SERS_data_test", "_manifest_name": "SERS_data_test", "_dataset_params": {}}</data>
  <data key="d8">[-0.02983739, 0.009263082671999934, 0.005844395855751904, 1.652204925298691, 0.18939548755645755]</data>
</edge>
